ally increase the monster's aggression.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798570/extras/8c88aac0405b54b14501876764b2ae86.poster.avif?t=1747475296\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798570/extras/8c88aac0405b54b14501876764b2ae86.webm?t=1747475296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1798570/extras/8c88aac0405b54b14501876764b2ae86.mp4?t=1747475296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Control the Gas:</strong> Manipulate the gas switches, which are operational only when the generator is powered, to safely navigate through different rooms.",
